---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_pause: investor calls claimTokenAllocation(totalAlloc, immediateAlloc, vestingSchedule, merkleProof)
    q_check_pause --> q_error_paused: contract is paused
    q_error_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_check_pause --> q_check_supplied: contract not paused
    q_check_supplied --> q_error_supplied: tokensAlreadySupplied == false
    q_error_supplied --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_check_supplied --> q_check_claimed: tokensAlreadySupplied == true
    q_check_claimed --> q_error_claimed: position.tokensClaimed == true
    q_error_claimed --> [*]: revert TokensAlreadyClaimed
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_proof: position.tokensClaimed == false
    q_verify_proof --> q_error_proof: MerkleProof.verify(proof, claimMerkleRoot, leaf) == false
    q_error_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_verify_proof --> q_calc_vesting: proof valid
    q_calc_vesting --> q_check_vesting: vestingAmount = totalAlloc - immediateAlloc
    q_check_vesting --> q_transfer_immediate: vestingAmount == 0
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: vestingAmount > 0
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_vesting: deploy VestingContract(investor, vestingSchedule)
    q_transfer_vesting --> q_store_vesting: transfer vestingAmount of askToken to vestingContract
    q_store_vesting --> q_transfer_immediate: position.vestingContract = vestingContract
    q_transfer_immediate --> q_update: transfer immediateAlloc of askToken to investor
    q_update --> q_emit: position.tokensClaimed = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokenAllocationClaimed(investor, immediateAlloc, vestingAmount, vestingContract)

    note right of q_verify_proof
        INV-001: Token claim uses Merkle proof for allocation verification
        INV-002: totalAlloc = immediateAlloc + vestingAmount
        INV-003: Each investor claims exactly once (tokensClaimed flag)
        INV-004: Vesting contract deployed only when vestingAmount > 0
        INV-005: Sum of all claimed tokens <= totalTokensAllocated
    end note
